{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_37","type":"agent_message","text":"The existing ontology already has `MONDO:0012890` for TSEN2-related pontocerebellar hypoplasia type 2B, but the requested label and newer literature describe a broader TSEN2-related neurodevelopmental disorder with renal/TMA involvement. I’m treating this as a distinct new gene-related disease term under neurodevelopmental disorder, without changing the existing PCH2B term."}}
